oke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-down size-5 drop-shadow-md sm:size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path><path d=\"m19 12-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg></span></button></div></section><div class=\"relative mb-20 flex w-full items-center justify-center px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 md:px-16 lg:px-20 bg-background\"><div class=\"flex max-w-5xl flex-col items-center text-center font-unbounded text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.35] tracking-wide sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl md:leading-[1.3] lg:text-4xl text-cap-green\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden py-[0.12em]\"><p class=\"m-0\" style=\"transform:translateY(110%)\">Spécialisée dans la production et la transformation du palmier à huile en République Démocratique du Congo,</p></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden py-[0.12em]\"><p class=\"m-0\" style=\"transform:translateY(110%)\">notre entreprise se positionne en tant qu’acteur pleinement engagé dans le développement durable de la filière agro-industrielle.</p></div></div></div><div style=\"height:400vh\" class=\"relative w-full z-20\"><div class=\"sticky top-0 relative h-screen w-full flex flex-col lg:flex-row overflow-hidden\" style=\"touch-action:pan-y\"><div class=\"relative w-full lg:w-1/2 h-[40vh] lg:h-full overflow-hidden bg-black\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 origin-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(5%) scale(1.1)\"><img alt=\"AGRO PALM Phase 1\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagro-palm%2Fimage2.jpeg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagro-palm%2Fimage2.jpeg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagro-palm%2Fimage2.jpeg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagro-palm%2Fimage2.jpeg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagro-palm%2Fimage2.jpeg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_nex