ursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-full font-unbounded text-[10px] font-bold shadow-sm ring-1 ring-current/20 transition-shadow hover:shadow-md focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-cap-yellow lg:size-11 lg:text-xs\" tabindex=\"0\">03</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-label=\"Aller à la phase 4\" class=\"flex size-9 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-full font-unbounded text-[10px] font-bold shadow-sm ring-1 ring-current/20 transition-shadow hover:shadow-md focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-cap-yellow lg:size-11 lg:text-xs\" tabindex=\"0\">04</button></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Passer à la phase suivante\" class=\"group flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-current/30 bg-current/10 px-3 py-1.5 opacity-90 transition hover:bg-current/20 md:gap-3 md:px-4 md:py-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(-4px)\"><span class=\"font-unbounded text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] md:text-xs\"><span class=\"md:hidden\">Glisser</span><span class=\"hidden md:inline\">Défiler</span></span><span class=\"flex items-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-down size-4 md:size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path><path d=\"m19 12-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class=\"w-full mt-auto mb-8 lg:my-auto\"><div class=\"relative w-full min-h-[5.5rem] sm:min-h-[6.5rem] md:min-h-[8rem] lg:min-h-[10rem]\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col justify-center\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(8px);transform:translateY(30px) scale(0.98)\"><h2 class=\"font-unbounded text-xl font-bold uppercase leading-[1.15] tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl xl:text-[2.75rem]\" aria-label=\"De la palmeraie à l’huile certifiée marchés\"><span>De la </span><span style=\"color:#f7d616\" class=\"font-black\">palmeraie</span><span> à l’huile certifiée </span><span style=\"color:#f7d616\" class=\"font-black\">marchés</span></h2></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col justify-center\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(8px);transform:translateY(30px) scale(0.98)\"><h2 class=\"font-unbounded text-xl font-bold uppercase leading-[1.15] tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl xl:text-[2.75rem]\" aria-label=\"Ressources nationales, emplois et communautés\"><span style=\"color:#3d632f\" class=\"font-black\">Ressources</span><span> nationales, </span><span style=\"color:#3d632f\" class=\"font-black\">emplois</span><span> et communautés</span></h2></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col justify-center\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(8px);transform:translateY(30px) scale(0.98)\"><h2 class=\"font-unbounded text-xl font-bold uppercase leading-[1.15] tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl xl:text-[2.75rem]\" aria-label=\"Méthodes responsables et conformité industrielle\"><span>Méthodes </span><span style=\"color:#f7d616\" class=\"font-black\">responsables</span><span> et conformité </span><span style=\"color:#f7d616\" class=\"font-black\">industrielle</span></h2></div></div></div><div class=\"w-full max-w-xl relative flex flex-col justify-end min-h-[160px] lg:min-h-[180px]\"><div class=\"relative w-full h-24 lg:h-28\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"font-sora text-sm md:text-base lg:text-lg leading-relaxed opacity-90 text-pretty font-medium\">Maîtrisant l’ensemble de la chaîne de valeur, de la culture des palmeraies à la transformation des fruits, nous assurons la production d’une huile de palme répondant rigoureusement aux exigences des marchés locaux et internationaux.</p></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"font-sora text-sm md:text-base lg:text-lg leading-relaxed opacity-90 text-pretty font-medium\">Notre mission consiste à valoriser les ressources naturelles nationales tout en favorisant la création d’emplois locaux et le développement économique des communautés environnantes.</p></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"font-sora text-sm md:text-base lg:text-lg leading-relaxed opacity-90 text-pretty font-medium\">Par le recours à des méthodes de production optimisées et responsables, nous nous engageons à fournir des produits fiables, compétitifs et strictement conformes aux besoins des industries alimentaires et non alimentaires.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"w-full\"><section class=\"relative my-10 flex w-full flex-col bg-background\" aria-labelledby=\"activity-palmeraie-kisangani\"><header class=\"shrink-0 px-5 pb-4 pt-8 sm:px-8 sm:pt-10 md:px-12 lg:px-16\"><p class=\"font-unbounded text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-cap-green sm:text-xs\">Activités</p><h2 id=\"activity-palmeraie-kisangani\" class=\"mt-2 font-unbounded text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-cap-dark sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl\">Palmeraie Kisangani</h2><p class=\"mt-1.5 font-sora text-sm font-medium text-cap-grey md:text-base\">De la pépinière à la récolte</p></header><div class=\"relative mx-auto w-full px-5 sm:px-8 md:px-12 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"relative h-[600px] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-cap-dark/10 bg-card shadow-lg md:h-[650px]\"><div class=\"relative flex h-full min-h-0 flex-col-reverse md:flex-row\"><div class=\"z-10 grid h-fit max-h-[45%] w-full grid-cols-1 overflow-y-auto bg-background/95 p-3 backdrop-blur-md md:flex md:h-full md:max-h-none md:min-h-0 md:w-[380px] md:shrink-0 md:flex-col md:overflow-hidden md:p-0 md:bg-gradient-to-b md:from-background md:to-background/80\"><button type=\"button\" aria-selected=\"true\" class=\"cursor-pointer opacity-100 group relative border-cap-dark/10 p-4 text-left transition-colors duration-300 md:flex md:min-h-0 md:flex-1 md:items-center md:border-b md:border-b-cap-dark/10 last:border-b-0 hover:bg-cap-dark/[0.03] aria-selected:bg-cap-dark/[0.06]\"><div class=\"relative z-10 pl-2 md:flex md:h-full md:w-full md:flex-col md:justify-center md:pl-4\"><h3 class=\"relative mb-2 w-fit rounded-sm px-2.5 py-1 font-sora text-xs font-bold md:text-sm bg-cap-green text-background\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 tabular-nums opacity-80\">01</span>Pré-pépinière &amp; pépinière</h3><p class=\"line-clamp-2 font-sora text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed text-cap-grey md:text-sm\">De la germination au développement, chaque jeune plant reçoit un suivi rigoureux pour former des palmiers robustes, indispensables à une production durable.</p></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 max-h-full max-w-full overflow-hidden\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuenow=\"0\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-1.5 w-full md:top-0 md:left-0 md:h-full md:w-1.5 bg-cap-green\" style=\"width:0%\"></span></div></button><button type=\"button\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"cursor-pointer opacity-50 group relative border-cap-dark/10 p-4 text-left transition-colors duration-300 md:flex md:min-h-0 md:flex-1 md:items-center md:border-b md:border-b-cap-dark/10 last:border-b-0 hover:bg-cap-dark/[0.03] aria-selected:bg-cap-dark/[0.06]\"><div class=\"relative z-10 pl-2 md:flex md:h-full md:w-full md:flex-col md:justify-center md:pl-4\"><h3 class=\"relative mb-2 w-fit rounded-sm px-2.5 py-1 font-sora text-xs font-bold md:text-sm bg-cap-green text-background\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 tabular-nums opacity-80\">02</span>Présentation – Plantation de deuxième et troisième année</h3><p class=\"line-clamp-2 font-sora text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed text-cap-grey md:text-sm\">Nos palmiers gagnent en maturité grâce à des pratiques agricoles durables, témoignant de notre engagement pour la RDC.</p></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 max-h-full max-w-full overflow-hidden\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuenow=\"0\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-1.5 w-full md:top-0 md:left-0 md:h-full md:w-1.5 bg-cap-green\" style=\"width:0%\"></span></div></button><button type=\"button\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"cursor-pointer opacity-50 group relative border-cap-dark/10 p-4 text-left transition-colors duration-300 md:flex md:min-h-0 md:flex-1 md:items-center md:border-b md:border-b-cap-dark/10 last:border-b-0 hover:bg-cap-dark/[0.03] aria-selected:bg-cap-dark/[0.06]\"><div class=\"relative z-10 pl-2 md:flex md:h-full md:w-full md:flex-col md:justify-center md:pl-4\"><h3 class=\"relative mb-2 w-fit rounded-sm px-2.5 py-1 font-sora text-xs font-bold md:text-sm bg-cap-green text-background\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 tabular-nums opacity-80\">03</span>Rings, rigoles &amp; récolte</h3><p class=\"line-clamp-2 font-sora text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed text-cap-grey md:text-sm\">Rings et rigoles retiennent eau et nutriments. Chaque régime d&#x27;environ 5 kg récolté témoigne de notre exigence de qualité.</p></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 max-h-full max-w-full overflow-hidden\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuenow=\"0\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-1.5 w-full md:top-0 md:left-0 md:h-full md:w-1.5 bg-cap-green\" style=\"width:0%\"></span></div></button></div><div class=\"relative min-h-0 w-full flex-1 md:h-full md:min-w-0 border-l border-cap-dark/10\"><div class=\"group absolute inset-0 h-full w-full\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div class=\"relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Pré-pépinière &amp; pépinière\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-center transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-105\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 70vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagro-palm%2Factivity1%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagro-palm%2Factivity1%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagro-palm%2Factivity1%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagro-palm%2Factivity1%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagro-palm%2Factivity1%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagro-palm%2Factivity1%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagro-palm%2Factivity1%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagro-palm%2Factivity1%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagro-palm%2Factivity1%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"relative my-10 flex w-full flex-col bg-background\" aria-labelledby=\"activity-usine-huile-tshela\"><header class=\"shrink-0 px-5 pb-4 pt-8 sm:px-8 sm:pt-10 md:px-12 lg:px-16\"><p class=\"font-unbounded text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-cap-green sm:text-xs\">Activités</p><h2 id=\"activity-usine-huile-tshela\" class=\"mt-2 font-unbounded text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-cap-dark sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl\">Usine Huile Tshela</h2><p class=\"mt-1.5 font-sora text-sm font-medium text-cap-grey md:text-base\">Pour la transformation</p></header><div class=\"relative mx-auto w-full px-5 sm:px-8 md:px-12 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"relative h-[600px] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-cap-dark/10 bg-card shadow-lg md:h-[650px]\"><div class=\"relative flex h-full min-h-0 flex-col-reverse md:flex-row\"><div class=\"z-10 grid h-fit max-h-[45%] w-full grid-cols-1 overflow-y-auto bg-background/95 p-3 backdrop-blur-md md:flex md:h-full md:max-h-none md:min-h-0 md:w-[380px] md:shrink-0 md:flex-col md:overflow-hidden md:p-0 md:bg-gradient-to-b md:from-background md:to-background/80\"><button type=\"button\" aria-selected=\"true\" class=\"cursor-pointer opacity-100 group relative border-cap-dark/10 p-4 text-left transition-colors duration-300 md:flex md:min-h-0 md:flex-1 md:items-center md:border-b md:border-b-cap-dark/10 last:border-b-0 hover:bg-cap-dark/[0.03] aria-selected:bg-cap-dark/[0.06]\"><div class=\"relative z-10 pl-2 md:flex md:h-full md:w-full md:flex-col md:justify-center md:pl-4\"><h3 class=\"relative mb-2 w-fit rounded-sm px-2.5 py-1 font-sora text-xs font-bold md:text-sm bg-cap-green text-background\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 tabular-nums opacity-80\">01</span>Déchargement tri des régimes et Contrôle de qualité des régimes</h3><p class=\"line-clamp-2 font-sora text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed text-cap-grey md:text-sm\">À la réception, les régimes sont triés et inspectés : seuls les régimes sains et conformes partent à l&#x27;usine.</p></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 max-h-full max-w-full overflow-hidden\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuenow=\"0\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-1.5 w-full md:top-0 md:left-0 md:h-full md:w-1.5 bg-cap-green\" style=\"width:0%\"></span></div></button><button type=\"button\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"cursor-pointer opacity-50 group relative border-cap-dark/10 p-4 text-left transition-colors duration-300 md:flex md:min-h-0 md:flex-1 md:items-center md:border-b md:border-b-cap-dark/10 last:border-b-0 hover:bg-cap-dark/[0.03] aria-selected:bg-cap-dark/[0.06]\"><div class=\"relative z-10 pl-2 md:flex md:h-full md:w-full md:flex-col md:justify-center md:pl-4\"><h3 class=\"relative mb-2 w-fit rounded-sm px-2.5 py-1 font-sora text-xs font-bold md:text-sm bg-cap-green text-background\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 tabular-nums opacity-80\">02</span>Acheminement vers le stérilisateur et Passage au grattoir après la cuisson</h3><p class=\"line-clamp-2 font-sora text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed text-cap-grey md:text-sm\">Les régimes sont cuits en stérilisateur, puis un grattoir sépare fruits et rafles pour acheminer les noix vers le pressage.</p></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 max-h-full max-w-full overflow-hidden\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuenow=\"0\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-1.5 w-full md:top-0 md:left-0 md:h-full md:w-1.5 bg-cap-green\" style=\"width:0%\"></span></div></button><button type=\"button\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"cursor-pointer opacity-50 group relative border-cap-dark/10 p-4 text-left transition-colors duration-300 md:flex md:min-h-0 md:flex-1 md:items-center md:border-b md:border-b-cap-dark/10 last:border-b-0 hover:bg-cap-dark/[0.03] aria-selected:bg-cap-dark/[0.06]\"><div class=\"relative z-10 pl-2 md:flex md:h-full md:w-full md:flex-col md:justify-center md:pl-4\"><h3 class=\"relative mb-2 w-fit rounded-sm px-2.5 py-1 font-sora text-xs font-bold md:text-sm bg-cap-green text-background\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 tabular-nums opacity-80\">03</span>Filtration &amp; stockage des huiles</h3><p class=\"line-clamp-2 font-sora text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed text-cap-grey md:text-sm\">Les noix sont pressées pour extraire l&#x27;huile brute, puis décantées afin d&#x27;éliminer les impuretés.</p></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 max-h-full max-w-full overflow-hidden\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuenow=\"0\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-1.5 w-full md:top-0 md:left-0 md:h-full md:w-1.5 bg-cap-green\" style=\"width:0%\"></span></div></button><button type=\"button\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"cursor-pointer opacity-50 group relative border-cap-dark/10 p-4 text-left transition-colors duration-300 md:flex md:min-h-0 md:flex-1 md:items-center md:border-b md:border-b-cap-dark/10 last:border-b-0 hover:bg-cap-dark/[0.03] aria-selected:bg-cap-dark/[0.06]\"><div class=\"relative z-10 pl-2 md:flex md:h-full md:w-full md:flex-col md:justify-center md:pl-4\"><h3 class=\"relative mb-2 w-fit rounded-sm px-2.5 py-1 font-sora text-xs font-bold md:text-sm bg-cap-green text-background\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 tabular-nums opacity-80\">04</span>Filtration &amp; stockage des huiles</h3><p class=\"line-clamp-2 font-sora text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed text-cap-grey md:text-sm\">Après filtration, les huiles passent en cuves et tanks finaux : CPO (palme rouge) et CPKO (palmiste).</p></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 max-h-full max-w-full overflow-hidden\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuenow=\"0\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-1.5 w-full md:top-0 md:left-0 md:h-full md:w-1.5 bg-cap-green\" style=\"width:0%\"></span></div></button></div><div class=\"relative min-h-0 w-full flex-1 md:h-full md:min-w-0 border-l border-cap-dark/10\"><div class=\"group absolute inset-0 h-full w-full\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div class=\"relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Déchargement tri des régimes et Contrôle de qualité des régimes\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-center transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-105\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 70vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagro-palm%2Factivity2%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagro-palm%2Factivity2%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagro-palm%2Factivity2%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagro-palm%2Factivity2%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagro-palm%2Factivity2%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagro-palm%2Factivity2%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagro-palm%2Factivity2%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagro-palm%2Factivity2%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagro-palm%2Factivity2%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"relative my-10 flex w-full flex-col bg-background\" aria-labelledby=\"activity-unites-de-production-produits-agro-palm\"><header class=\"shrink-0 px-5 pb-4 pt-8 sm:px-8 sm:pt-10 md:px-12 lg:px-16\"><p class=\"font-unbounded text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-cap-green sm:text-xs\">Activités</p><h2 id=\"activity-unites-de-production-produits-agro-palm\" class=\"mt-2 font-unbounded text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-cap-dark sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl\">Unités de Production &amp; Produits - Agro Palm</h2><p class=\"mt-1.5 font-sora text-sm font-medium text-cap-grey md:text-base\">De la transformation aux produits finis</p></header><div class=\"relative mx-auto w-full px-5 sm:px-8 md:px-12 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"relative h-[600px] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-cap-dark/10 bg-card shadow-lg md:h-[650px]\"><div class=\"relative flex h-full min-h-0 flex-col-reverse md:flex-row\"><div class=\"z-10 grid h-fit max-h-[45%] w-full grid-cols-1 overflow-y-auto bg-background/95 p-3 backdrop-blur-md md:flex md:h-full md:max-h-none md:min-h-0 md:w-[380px] md:shrink-0 md:flex-col md:overflow-hidden md:p-0 md:bg-gradient-to-b md:from-background md:to-background/80\"><button type=\"button\" aria-selected=\"true\" class=\"cursor-pointer opacity-100 group relative border-cap-dark/10 p-4 text-left transition-colors duration-300 md:flex md:min-h-0 md:flex-1 md:items-center md:border-b md:border-b-cap-dark/10 last:border-b-0 hover:bg-cap-dark/[0.03] aria-selected:bg-cap-dark/[0.06]\"><div class=\"relative z-10 pl-2 md:flex md:h-full md:w-full md:flex-col md:justify-center md:pl-4\"><h3 class=\"relative mb-2 w-fit rounded-sm px-2.5 py-1 font-sora text-xs font-bold md:text-sm bg-cap-green text-background\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 tabular-nums opacity-80\">01</span>Savonnerie CAP Congo Agro Palm</h3><p class=\"line-clamp-2 font-sora text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed text-cap-grey md:text-sm\">Unité industrielle produisant des savons de qualité pour ménages et professionnels, contribuant à l&#x27;industrialisation de la RDC et au Made in Congo.</p></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 max-h-full max-w-full overflow-hidden\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuenow=\"0\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-1.5 w-full md:top-0 md:left-0 md:h-full md:w-1.5 bg-cap-green\" style=\"width:0%\"></span></div></button><button type=\"button\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"cursor-pointer opacity-50 group relative border-cap-dark/10 p-4 text-left transition-colors duration-300 md:flex md:min-h-0 md:flex-1 md:items-center md:border-b md:border-b-cap-dark/10 last:border-b-0 hover:bg-cap-dark/[0.03] aria-selected:bg-cap-dark/[0.06]\"><div class=\"relative z-10 pl-2 md:flex md:h-full md:w-full md:flex-col md:justify-center md:pl-4\"><h3 class=\"relative mb-2 w-fit rounded-sm px-2.5 py-1 font-sora text-xs font-bold md:text-sm bg-cap-green text-background\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 tabular-nums opacity-80\">02</span>L&#x27;usine d&#x27;huile – CAP Congo Agro Palm</h3><p class=\"line-clamp-2 font-sora text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed text-cap-grey md:text-sm\">Transformation moderne des régimes de palme en une huile de qualité, valorisant nos plantations pour le développement agro-industriel de la RDC.</p></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 max-h-full max-w-full overflow-hidden\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuenow=\"0\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-1.5 w-full md:top-0 md:left-0 md:h-full md:w-1.5 bg-cap-green\" style=\"width:0%\"></span></div></button><button type=\"button\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"cursor-pointer opacity-50 group relative border-cap-dark/10 p-4 text-left transition-colors duration-300 md:flex md:min-h-0 md:flex-1 md:items-center md:border-b md:border-b-cap-dark/10 last:border-b-0 hover:bg-cap-dark/[0.03] aria-selected:bg-cap-dark/[0.06]\"><div class=\"relative z-10 pl-2 md:flex md:h-full md:w-full md:flex-col md:justify-center md:pl-4\"><h3 class=\"relative mb-2 w-fit rounded-sm px-2.5 py-1 font-sora text-xs font-bold md:text-sm bg-cap-green text-background\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 tabular-nums opacity-80\">03</span>L&#x27;usine d&#x27;huile – CAP Congo Agro Palm (Chaîne de production)</h3><p class=\"line-clamp-2 font-sora text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed text-cap-grey md:text-sm\">Transformation moderne des régimes de palme en une huile de qualité, valorisant nos plantations pour le développement agro-industriel de la RDC.</p></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 max-h-full max-w-full overflow-hidden\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuenow=\"0\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-1.5 w-full md:top-0 md:left-0 md:h-full md:w-1.5 bg-cap-green\" style=\"width:0%\"></span></div></button><button type=\"button\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"cursor-pointer opacity-50 group relative border-cap-dark/10 p-4 text-left transition-colors duration-300 md:flex md:min-h-0 md:flex-1 md:items-center md:border-b md:border-b-cap-dark/10 last:border-b-0 hover:bg-cap-dark/[0.03] aria-selected:bg-cap-dark/[0.06]\"><div class=\"relative z-10 pl-2 md:flex md:h-full md:w-full md:flex-col md:justify-center md:pl-4\"><h3 class=\"relative mb-2 w-fit rounded-sm px-2.5 py-1 font-sora text-xs font-bold md:text-sm bg-cap-green text-background\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 tabular-nums opacity-80\">04</span>L&#x27;emballage : la touche finale d&#x27;une qualité préservée</h3><p class=\"line-clamp-2 font-sora text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed text-cap-grey md:text-sm\">Conditionnement moderne et précis des pots de margarine, garantissant hygiène, protection et conservation de la fraîcheur.</p></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 max-h-full max-w-full overflow-hidden\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuenow=\"0\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-1.5 w-full md:top-0 md:left-0 md:h-full md:w-1.5 bg-cap-green\" style=\"width:0%\"></span></div></button></div><div class=\"relative min-h-0 w-full flex-1 md:h-full md:min-w